.\n\nThere\u2019s no filler, no story, and no downtime. Just pure, skill-based action.\n\nThe Gameplay:\n\nPure Arcade Focus: Every second counts. Every shot matters. Your score is everything.\n\nColor-Based Combat: Switch your weapon color in real time and destroy only the matching cubes. The faster you react, the higher you score.\n\nDynamic Patterns: Targets spawn in increasingly complex formations. Stay fast, stay accurate, or lose momentum.\n\nInstant Replayability: Every run is a new chance to improve, adapt, and beat your best.\n\nGrab your blasters, lock in, and see how high you can go.", "short_description": "Cube PoP is a high-speed arcade shooter where reflex meets precision. Wield dual blasters and match your weapon color to shatter incoming cubes. Fast, intense, and all about pushing your score to the limit."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lab-vr.com/cubepop/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LABVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lab-vr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34909412028704133"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300897_918762941025470_5987860998605958704_n.png?stp=dst-